flowchart TD
    Checks[Tests and mocked Terraform checks] --> Review[Review actual AWS target plan and cost]
    Review --> Up[Type UP]
    Up --> Terraform[Terraform creates the demo stack]
    Terraform --> Builds[EC2 builds images and websites]
    Builds --> Workloads[Install Kubernetes and migrate database]
    Workloads --> Hosting[Publish sites and configure accounts/webhook]
    Hosting --> Verify[Base API/auth/TLS/SQL checks]
    Verify --> Walkthrough[Visitor payment gate ride reporting]
    Walkthrough --> Down[Review deletion and type DOWN]
    Down --> Backup[Verify off-server database backup]
    Backup --> Destroy[Terraform deletes approved stack]
    Destroy --> Retry[Guarded detached-IP retry if needed]
    Retry --> Audit[Audit no active demo resources]
    Audit --> Retain[Retain private state backups and deployment IAM]
